dn29:10.2 starts: then a holy life of that sort is incomplete
dn29:10.3 starts: But when a holy life is endowed with those
dn29:10.4 starts: then a holy life of that sort is complete
dn29:12.7 starts: there are monk disciples of his of middle standing,
dn29:12.8 starts: there are junior monk disciples of his,
dn29:12.9 starts: there are elder nun disciples of his,
dn29:12.10 starts: there are nun disciples of his of middle standing,
dn29:12.11 starts: there are junior nun disciples of his,
dn29:12.12 starts: there are male lay disciples of his, householders wearing white, following the celibate life,
dn29:12.13 starts: there are male lay disciples of his, householders wearing white, partaking of sensuality,
dn29:12.14 starts: there are female lay disciples of his, householders wearing white, following the celibate life,
dn29:18.2 starts: and if the thought occurs to you,
dn29:30.12 starts: “both exists & does not exist…”…
dn29:30.17 starts: “neither does nor doesn’t exist: Only this is
dn29:34.11 starts: ‘The self & the cosmos are both eternal
